      "originalHash": "439f3618b76234b95ccd3ddf7b1cbfe691922124ad772394e30f03b1c4d60d02",
      "sourceFileHash": "a810cc84574164277e04fdb6b5404fe3b97a3ac292b6e592c3811e9d8640483c",
      "originalText": "「やから……%CALLNAME% の好きなところ、もっと教えてくれへんか……？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "685fdf8fc549ebcdfec741403f2be303",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/102100-Tamamo-Cross/ero-21.kojo",
