        2,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "3697f644d54d2da3b39930fbfe3918f424c250a4414eed72b1f2cad06e397b1d",
      "sourceFileHash": "a810cc84574164277e04fdb6b5404fe3b97a3ac292b6e592c3811e9d8640483c",
      "originalText": "%SEX%の両脚はゆっくりと、慌てず、だが獲物がちょうど逃げられない力で、%YOU% の下半身を擦り続ける……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1f2ee8e7ae526327bbad4bbe2de77258",
